  "_comment": "A beach lap that spends two fifths of itself under the sea. The promenade along the shore, a banked climb over the headland, then the road drops off the point into the lagoon: along the lagoon floor a stream carries the karts with it, a vent throws them up its bubbles, and a hull breach on the right leads through the sunken wreck (narrow, dark, crates in the hold, a dash strip out of the stern). Up over the reef onto the far beach, a glide over the rocky inlet, then the dunes dive into the grotto: a rip current across the road comes and goes on a timer and a vent blows on the last lap. Out onto the sand and back to the line.",
